 🌟 About

MAIAMMA School ERP is an AI-powered cloud-based school ecosystem designed to digitally transform educational institutions.

Unlike traditional ERPs that only manage attendance and fees, MAIAMMA combines School Administration + AI + Learning + STEM + Robotics + Interactive 3D Science into one modern platform.

Designed for:

🏫 Schools  
🎓 Colleges  
📚 Coaching Institutes  
🏛 Educational Trusts



